                <pb facs="0156" n="147" sameAs="frus:frus1940v02/pg147"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.111 Quota 56/276: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Consul General at
                        Amsterdam</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Lee</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1940-07-28T10:00:00-04:00">July 28, 1940—10
                            a.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>128. Your 340, 17th. You are authorized to issue nonpreference visas under the
                    Netherland quota in urgent cases to nonquota relatives of American citizens.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Welles</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
